# Parent UI

- Figma-style builder: chat/prompt left, live canvas right on desktop; stack on small screens
- Folder layout: `components/{layout,chat,canvas}`, `hooks/`, `api/` — keep `App.tsx` as composition only
- HTTP to the API lives in `src/api/`, never inside presentational components
- Subscribe to SSE `/sessions/:id/events` — no polling
- Set iframe `src` to sandbox `previewUrl` only (placeholder until P1-S4 / P3-S1)
- Live canvas is the iframe. Do not use Monaco as the running app. An optional Code tab is out of scope unless a later story adds it
- On `preview.ready` / `editor.completed`, refresh iframe without a full page reload
- Smart Match: show Use existing vs Build new; do not auto-accept
